//! The **About floater** (`viewer-about-floater`): viewer name and version
//! (build-time `git describe`), the connected grid and region with its
//! simulator version, runtime system information (OS, CPU, memory, GPU as
//! reported by wgpu) — all copyable to the clipboard as one block, the
//! support workflow the reference's "Copy to Clipboard" exists for — plus
//! credits and the third-party license texts generated by `cargo about`
//! (`scripts/generate-third-party-licenses.sh`, embedded at compile time).
//!
//! The copyable support block deliberately uses **English labels** regardless
//! of the UI locale, so pasted blocks stay grep-able / comparable for support
//! staff; the surrounding chrome (title, tab labels, buttons, credits) is
//! Fluent-localised like the rest of the UI.
//!
//! Reference (Firestorm, read-only): `llfloaterabout.{h,cpp}`,
//! `floater_about.xml`, `LLAppViewer::getViewerInfoString`.

